            <title>2.10.62</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 21:40:40 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>80</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.10.62</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.62

- Fixed the long-running stall that could leave the overlay showing an old song while YouTube Music continued playing.
- Chrome extension updates now drive the overlay directly, with AppleScript retained as an automatic fallback.
- Native music app probes now run concurrently with hard deadlines, so an unresponsive paused app cannot freeze Now.
- Playback controls now rediscover the matching YouTube Music tab after a transport reset instead of showing “Open YouTube Music.”
- The Chrome extension listener automatically restarts if its loopback connection fails.
- Added Restart Now to the menu bar for a safe, one-click full relaunch.
]]></description>
